<title>USA: AlliedSignal names unit president.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal names unit president.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS TOWNSHIP, New Jersey 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlliedSignal Inc said on Tuesday it has named Geoff Wild president of its electronic materials business.</p>
<p>The appointment will take effect immediately.</p>
<p>The electronic materials business is based in Santa Clara, California.</p>
<p>Wild previously was president and division director of Johnson Matthey Plc's electronics materials divison based in Spokane, Washington.</p>
<p>He has succeeded Mark Bulriss, who last month was named president of AlliedSignal's polymers unit.</p>
</text>
